✅ Status Check 2/2 in AWS
In Amazon EC2,
 “Status check: 2/2” = Everything is healthy ✅
🔍 What are these 2 checks?
AWS runs 2 types of health checks on every EC2 instance:
1️⃣ System Status Check
Checks AWS infrastructure
Hardware, network, power, host machine
2️⃣ Instance Status Check
Checks your OS inside instance
CPU, memory, OS boot, networking inside VM 
